WEBVTT

00:06:30.476 --> 00:06:32.156
So how do we change this?

00:06:32.836 --> 00:06:37.436
First, we need to acknowledge
that the problem is complex.

00:06:38.356 --> 00:06:41.956
There are close to 85,000
villages in Indonesia,

00:06:41.996 --> 00:06:46.676
about 25,000 of them
are located in and around forests.

00:06:47.436 --> 00:06:50.996
Each have their own
complexities and challenges,

00:06:51.036 --> 00:06:54.716
but each of them also has its own Sumini.

00:06:55.556 --> 00:06:59.876
It is up to us to find them,

00:06:59.876 --> 00:07:01.476
work with them